  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prevention and response to sexual and gender based violence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to strengthen the resilience of women, girls and survivors of SGBV in Madgascar through an integrated multi-sectoral response. This is to be achieved through three outcomes: 1) strengthening of national and institutional capacities to provide access to essential services for SGBV-victims, 2)   women, adolescents and young girls have better access to information and integrated assistance and 3) Interventions for prevention and responses are effectively coordinated.</narrative>
  </description>
